{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >College, football, loyal friends, and career plans... All of it vanishes after an unexpected phone call. A new city, new challenges. And only one person remains close and true \u2014 the rebellious redhead, Kristina.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297210/extras/750ca69d35ac555316361750bf95313a.avif?t=1755281278\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297210/extras_big/750ca69d35ac555316361750bf95313a.avif?t=1755281278 width=800 height=1500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an exciting journey where you'll meet new friends and enemies, uncover mysteries, and thwart the plans of those who threaten you and your family!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297210/extras/caff094243fcf703de8669019a417700.avif?t=1755281278\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297210/extras_big/caff094243fcf703de8669019a417700.avif?t=1755281278 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your actions shape the story. There are no wrong choices \u2014 sometimes a failed quest is a choice in itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297210/extras/56cad7c737429d4b1e81781bd0975cf7.avif?t=1755281278\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297210/extras_big/56cad7c737429d4b1e81781bd0975cf7.avif?t=1755281278 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"A little tour of the library","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3297210/e89006cf257367